{"notices":[{"id":"notice-mu6ai2bq11o5","date":"2026-09-18","tag":"NOTICE","title":"안녕하세요, 로우키 레코즈입니다.","body":"안녕하세요. 로우키레코즈입니다.\n\n이곳에서 소속 아티스트의 음악과 활동 소식을 전합니다.\n\nARTIST에서는 아티스트 소개와 공식 채널을, NEWS에서는 발매 소식과 뮤직비디오, 활동 기록을 확인하실 수 있습니다. 레이블의 운영 및 모집·협업 안내는 NOTICE에 게시합니다.\n\n공연·섭외, 음악 제작, 협업 및 보도 자료 관련 문의는 아래 이메일로 보내주세요. 문의 내용과 회신받으실 연락처를 함께 남겨주시면 확인 후 답변드리겠습니다.\n\nlowkeyrecordzzz@gmail.com\n\n찾아주셔서 감사합니다.\n로우키레코즈\n\n-\n\nWelcome to LOWKEY RECORDZ.\n\nThis is where we share our artists’ music and updates.\n\nVisit ARTIST for artist profiles and links to their official channels. NEWS features releases, music videos, and highlights from their activities. NOTICE covers label announcements, open calls, and collaboration opportunities.\n\nFor live bookings, music production, collaborations, or press materials, please contact us at the email address below. Include details of your inquiry and your contact information so we can get back to you.\n\nlowkeyrecordzzz@gmail.com\n\nThank you for visiting.\nLOWKEY RECORDZ","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"","videoMode":"embed"}}],"news":[{"id":"news-mu5nyyocdhwt","date":"2022-05-24","title":"카라신 주니어, 'ALL Night Long' 발매","body":"Co. Produced by Karacin jr.\nInstrumental produced by Na0H\nLyrics by Karacin jr.\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/I8iH-LGo_9c?si=HGrNg-9FDgJ-wl6Q","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu696svhaks6","date":"2023-01-02","title":"카라신 주니어, '텅' 발매","body":"Co. Produced by Karacin jr.\nInstrumental produced by Na0H\nLyrics by Karacin jr.\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/pm6qplnWZpo?si=hA10q6yLvgZywzlh","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu698xv6thr8","date":"2023-02-22","title":"카라신 주니어, 'Mang Cut (feat. Na0H)' 발매","body":"Instrumental produced by Weedie Mane\nLyrics by Karacin jr., Na0H\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/-18u8JLJlgI?si=KUU1cZzaAfyYRxUw","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu69azmtuwoi","date":"2024-03-05","title":"카라신 주니어, 'OLATA (feat. kimmy)' 발매","body":"Instrumental produced by Weedie Mane\nLyrics by Karacin jr., kimmy\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/C8T4JkCQSYQ?si=vTxjMcUmLSaRGhpt","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu69byksm6wo","date":"2024-03-05","title":"카라신 주니어, 'South Side' 발매","body":"Instrumental produced by Weedie Mane\nLyrics by Karacin jr.\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/0tCtHTv8jv8?si=HRMYjA-khuAFOBzn","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu69g50ahd3x","date":"2023-11-16","title":"카라신 주니어, 'Welcome To My House (feat. kimmy)' 발매","body":"Co. Produced by Karacin jr.\nInstrumental produced by Na0H\nLyrics by Karacin jr., kimmy\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/DnBwVMaTzP8?si=PxF97FCOXawQwEt7","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu69il3xy2jq","date":"2025-01-07","title":"카라신 주니어, 'NONSTOP (feat. Weedie Mane)' 발매","body":"Co. Produced by Karacin jr.\nInstrumental produced by Weedie Mane\nLyrics by Karacin jr.\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/iYZeMeMCApc?si=cQgeQ66n1by0JD1a","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu69kxdtgaec","date":"2022-03-18","title":"카라신 주니어 & 나오, EP 'Pink Parad0x' 발매","body":"Co. Produced by Karacin jr.\nInstrumental produced by Nike Jean\nLyrics by Karacin jr., Nike Jean\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/dEsaGgO-79Y?si=WAf-QVR2TP0Du_rs","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu69rgeq5heo","date":"2026-09-17","title":"카라신 주니어, 'agree' 발매 및 뮤직비디오 공개","body":"카라신 주니어(Karacin jr.)가 싱글 ‘agree’의 공식 뮤직비디오를 9월17일 공개했습니다. 음원은 주요 스트리밍 플랫폼에서 감상할 수 있으며, 가사 번역본도 17개 언어로 제공됩니다.\n\n‘agree’는 트랩과 R&B, 팝을 결합한 곡입니다. 관계가 한 단계 가까워지기 직전의 긴장과 갈망을 담았으며, 느슨한 리듬과 절제된 보컬, 공간감 있는 신스가 몽환적인 분위기를 이끕니다. 오랜 기간 카라신 주니어와 협업해온 프로듀서 나이키 진(Nike Jean)이 프로덕션에 참여했습니다.\n\n뮤직비디오는 선악과와 뱀, 재탄생의 이미지를 통해 욕망이 선택으로, 선택이 변화로 이어지는 과정을 그립니다. 초현실적인 공간에 놓인 상징들은 곡에 담긴 유혹과 불안을 시각적으로 풀어냅니다.\n\n-\n\nKaracin jr. released the official music video for the single “agree” on September 17. The track is available on major streaming platforms, with lyric translations provided in 17 languages.\n\nBlending trap, R&B, and pop, “agree” captures the tension and longing just before a relationship grows more intimate. Laid-back rhythms, restrained vocals, and spacious synths create a dreamlike atmosphere. Longtime collaborator Nike Jean contributed to the track’s production.\n\nThrough imagery of forbidden fruit, a serpent, and rebirth, the music video explores how desire leads to choice, and choice to change. Set within surreal spaces, these symbols give visual form to the song’s sense of temptation and unease.\n\n-\n\nCo. Produced by Karacin jr.\nInstrumental produced by Nike Jean\nLyrics by Karacin jr.\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/aVXmJPoPCoU?si=tQu-6wZRS-U9WrRo","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu69xqkfp4ib","date":"2023-02-06","title":"나오, 'gener1c (feat. TAKUWA)' 발매","body":"Co. Produced by Na0H\nInstrumental produced by Na0H\nLyrics by Na0H, TAKUWA\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/gUGQqV0HTqg?si=25AsBFUetpPHoHFZ","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu69z0tmgkv8","date":"2022-03-25","title":"나오, 'Touch Tells Everything (feat. Dinosoul)' 발매","body":"Co. Produced by Na0H\nInstrumental produced by Na0H\nLyrics by Na0H, Dinosoul\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/lx4K6g8wmPI?si=aVBbno0dC8Tc8xBg","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu6a0app8c2l","date":"2022-08-09","title":"나오, 'CAFFEINE (feat. Aquadice, Karacin jr.)' 발매","body":"Co. Produced by Na0H\nInstrumental produced by Na0H\nLyrics by Na0H, Aquadice, Karacin jr.\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/XNmRtWf6fFM?si=IxP0MoeHZIQMV_yE","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu6a4ju32sct","date":"2023-05-11","title":"나오, 'Dominating!' 발매","body":"Co. Produced by Na0H\nInstrumental produced by Na0H\nArranged by Karacin jr.\nLyrics by Na0H\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/QD4wmjI61E0?si=h4CBwxczkiQNB3X1","videoMode":"embed"}},{"id":"news-mu6a8c0g1o8r","date":"2026-01-11","title":"세미, 데뷔 트랙 'Dreamed of You' 발매 및 뮤직비디오 공개","body":"Co. Produced by Na0H\nInstrumental produced by Na0H\nArranged by Karacin jr., Semi\nLyrics by Na0H, Semi\nPublished by Lowkey Recordz\nDistributed by Sound Republica, INC","images":[],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"https://youtu.be/JCJDKKkc7LA?si=u5TW1xiwXF9dl0DH","videoMode":"embed"}}],"journal":[],"store":[{"id":"store-mu93u7sgjygt","date":"2026-09-20","title":"test","body":"test","images":["data:image/jpeg;base64,"],"presentation":{"font":"sans","size":"13","placement":"after","width":"100","align":"center","video":"","videoMode":"embed"},"price":0,"status":"coming"}],"updatedAt":"2026-09-20T00:55:28.494Z"}